  "description": "The Eskute RT 72 is built for riders who want more out of every twist of the throttle—more speed, more range, and more capability when the pavement ends. With a performance-driven 72V platform and trail-focused components, it delivers the power and control to make every open stretch and rugged trail worth chasing.\n\nA 6500W peak mid-drive motor delivers an impressive 300 N·m of max torque, launching the RT 72 to speeds of 53+ MPH with strong, responsive acceleration. Feeding that power is a massive 72V 30Ah, 2160Wh battery, offering up to 70 miles of range for longer rides and fewer stops between adventures.\n\nIts 19×3.0” front and 17×3.0” rear all-terrain tires create a planted, agile setup across loose dirt and uneven ground. 160mm hydraulic front suspension works together with a performance hydraulic rear shock to soak up hard hits, smooth out rough sections, and maintain consistent wheel contact when the terrain gets demanding.\n\nPower is matched by serious stopping capability. 190mm hydraulic disc brakes provide strong, precise braking, while the smart display keeps speed, battery level, and gear information right in view. A spacious 20.9” ergonomic saddle adds support for longer sessions, and the LED headlight, brake light, and turn signals provide added visibility when the ride continues after sunset.\n\nThe RT 72 isn’t built just to look powerful. It’s built to put 72V performance to work—mile after mile, trail after trail.",
